    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e3687e5f7dd49e98714e02b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "耐力也相当优秀，所以能一直占据优位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57aad4cce203d25f0dfaaad1405fbe8470a009fb43f81bf9f9ffb79cc76839b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1447c08ec4592af78fa7f5c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总之，我必须先阻止她继续否定她自己。\r\n虽然只在模拟赛里见过一次……\r\n但我依旧可以列举出她的许多优点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fba49d711fd9c36cb4f2c497f49c23e25f203c1483cd82a6bf61d963441d423f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5714d12b8dc4252c7392e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，你在比赛中能明确地判断周围的形势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed476543126690ef978936b9314f21c69e71b537d27c9411dff70c47d73783a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be21717278fe01e6652a94a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，她很难被其他人迫至外道，\r\n也很难被其他人包围导致无法冲刺。\r\n而说到这个——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d846ecfb18b5b4f2b2ad792c486f30b426472036ea6f14465486dad05a724f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb3d20ccfd1df70dff0a3eaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中，再小的失误都有可能导致严重的后果。\r\n而若是能够保持冷静的话，\r\n她这样清晰掌握局势的才能将是一把宝刀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fcc18109f056da6e78e031e47f45c4fb490c575f46b5be5cb856d1315646434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbeb56f82782c64f450d1760",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "性格：自信がない、心配性、怖がり",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe609c2144ef268dacb25aff99351ce0480fd8beb78aa6606f66f12ae787e527",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee117478c25c92055acbdf1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我陪着高尚骏逸一同训练之后，\r\n已经过了相当一段时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9436703cc30c51638ceffe950dd3e5b7b625b1b194e2faf88321ea62c0e2e092",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1089/storytimeline_041089004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
