      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请各位牢记过去训练中的收获，拿出自己的全力！\r\n那么，首先是A组。\r\n请各就各位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11e45ee039bf19d99e7520757151aa179ac8f1f459e461d579c4140298fc23b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
