      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——战作一团的选手，终于突入了最终直线。\r\n领先的是北部玄驹；而高尚骏逸则紧随其后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d45a0fb3eb3fe6d70a0d398d2e65728e9dc4362121f8bb738bfa744c8fdbdf3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
